WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.000
It wasn't like the Pledge of Allegiance for us.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.500
So we weren't given the training

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.300
or the opportunity

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.000
to learn how to dissect or digest

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:23.300
or to own the Declaration.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:30.100
So for me, I didn't really encounter it until my adult years.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:34.100
And even then...

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.600
I think your first question was, how does it feel?
How did it feel?

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:41.700
Even then, the experience was layered.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:46.000
Even when we read it, there was anger,

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:49.500
there was frustration, there was despondency.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:53.800
It was a layered experience

00:00:53.900 --> 00:01:01.300
because it became a little overwhelming.
